OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA dry start with bright spells
OL,6,Fafter any early mist or fog patches
OL,7,Fclear. Turning rather cloudier through
OL,8,Fthe afternoon, perhaps with the odd
OL,9,Fspot of light rain or drizzle in
OL,10,Fplaces. An increasing breeze but mild.
OL,11,FMaximum Temperature 11C.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloudy overnight with the odd
OL,14,Fpatch of light rain or drizzle in
OL,15,Fplaces, although often dry. Brisk
OL,16,Fbreeze around the coast but lighter
OL,17,Finland. Mild. Minimum Temperature 8C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
