OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FCloudy with a weakening band
OL,6,Fof rain moving slowly east across the
OL,7,Fregion, eventually clearing offshore
OL,8,Fthrough the evening. Drier conditions
OL,9,Ffollow from the west. Lighter winds
OL,10,Fthan recent days. Maximum Temperature
OL,11,F12C.
OL,12,
OL,13,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDry
OL,14,Fstart Saturday, but further spells of
OL,15,Fwet and windy weather are expected at
OL,16,Ftimes through the period, with coastal
OL,17,Fgales possible. Temperatures remain
OL,18,Fabove average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
